	<Property Name="NI.Lib.DefaultMenu" Type="Str">BaseMessage.mnu</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Base class for all Messages in the Driver. It is in the message class that all the logic of a specific communication protocol needs to go. A message can format itself to a string. It can also parse a string from the remote destination and interprete it.</Property>
